<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH UTILITY JIHOMORAVSKA 9MO GROSS FALLS. [CORRECTED 14:32 GMT]</title>
<headline>CZECH UTILITY JIHOMORAVSKA 9MO GROSS FALLS. [CORRECTED 14:32 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine</p>
<p>months ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		 808.223     vs	890.973</p>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;808,223 vs 890,973&quot;)</p>
<p> Operating profit	   823.952     vs	900.120</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services	     8,632.882     vs    7,990.728</p>
<p> Total assets	    10,931.473     vs    8,742.211</p>
<p> Basic capital	    3,531.570     vs    3,483.275</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Jihomoravska Energetika a.s..</p>
<p>The firm is south-eastern Czech energy distributor. Figures</p>
<p>were provided by the company itself. Jihomoravska is listed on</p>
<p>the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
